#5000
The sunken temple courtyard~
   Pale light from the open sky pours always into this unsheltered
courtyard, mingling with the amber glow of standing torches.  The
flagstones are sunk a few steps below the surrounding streets, so that
the courtyard feels like a quiet bowl set apart from the town, and many
citizens of Cair-Irynthar find it their pleasure to lounge here.  The
dark marble temple rises like a shadow to the north, the vivid colors of
a rose garden spill out to the east, and the library lies to the west.
A stone arch leads south.
~
