#5001
The Temple of Mercy~
   A myriad of candles burning in amber hues lights this black-domed
temple.  This is where all adventurers of human ilk must begin their
trials of danger and discovery.  You stand in a cast of rosy-gold light
falling across the floor from a stained glass window, your first sight
of the known world.  The unknown world awaits you with open... jaws.  An
inscription is carved into the north wall.  Passages lead north to a
terrace, east to the alms room and west to the altar, and the courtyard
lies to the south.
~
