The town library~
   Silence reigns here.  Shelves of books and scrolls line two walls,
and the others are painted with black and gold arcs of mural designs:
bands twisted into knotlike patterns and borders.  Reading desks with
green-shaded lamps stand in neat rows.  Travelers and citizens may post
information on the board that hangs here.  The courtyard lies to the
east.
