#5009
The gate at the cliffs~
   The wind picks up and blows sharply at your hair and clothes as the
town falls behind and the world opens out before you.  You are standing
atop a highland cliff covered in mosses, lichen and purple heather,
looking out over a foggy wetland.  The graveyard of Cair-Irynthar lies
near the foot of the cliffs, and in the far distance the blue line of
the sea closes the horizon.  A gate leads north to the cliff's edge, and
the square lies to the south.
~
