#5021
Nightbreak Cafe~
   You have entered the infamous Nightbreak Cafe, home by night to those
who hide away by day.  It is well known to be run by the local
assassins' guild, and conversations here are spoken in whispers as deals
are cut and bounties arranged.  Candles gutter in wine bottles on the
tables, and the air is rich with the smell of strong coffee.  The rules
of conduct are etched on the back wall.  The door leads west, and a
trapdoor in the floor leads down.
~
