#5023
The southern path~
   The green grass and firm soil of the path give way here to mud strewn
with traces of human filth as you pass into the poorer section of
Cair-Irynthar.  Shanties lean against one another, and the town dump
adds its stench to the air, bearing witness to the robbery of the poor
by the rich... and often by the poor.  A shanty stands to the east, the
dump lies to the west, and the path runs north and south.
