#5052
The sparring hall~
   Shields and other items of heraldry line the sunken stone walls of
this sparring room, gleaming with human pride.  Without being too
boastful about it, the heads of past foes are stacked one atop the other
on a pole of polished wood in the corner.  Straw is scattered over the
floor to soak up the blood.  If you are looking to improve your skills
in the art of battle, this might be a good place to start.  Steps lie to
the east, and the lodge to the west.
