The post office~
   You narrowly avoid the swing of a rusted axe as you step through the
doorway of the town post office.  Some sort of riot seems to be under
way among the many disgruntled postal workers crowded here, and shining
silver letter openers flash in the light as they try to stab anyone in
sight.  It is a droll scene.  Mailbags lie torn open on the floor,
letters spilling everywhere.  A sign hangs on the wall.  The lane lies
to the east.
